<h1>Polling Stats</h1>
<p>Device polling statistics over time (from the polling RRD database).</p>

<div class="container">
  <div class="containerhead">Polling Statistics</div>
  <div class="containerbody">
    <table border="0">
      <tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><a href="/reports/poll?type=addr"><strong>Network Addresses</strong></a></td>
